7. When we track down the text datasets that feed into the initial models, which means tracing back quite a few steps, there's not much to tell us the origins. These giant datasets do not offer any more information about the journey this text took to arrive in this corpus, who authored it or when, what it might contain. No context in the documentation either. Comes from Reddit, Wikipedia. 

